<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Mitsubishi Motors rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Mitsubishi Motors rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research Ltd has assigned Mitsubishi Motors Corp a &quot;A&quot; rating, Daiwa Securities brokers saaid on Thursday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns an &quot;A&quot; ratinng to issues whose values it sees outperforming the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more thaan 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
